  people powered campaign to fight for working families over billionaires. 
 Please join us to knock on doors in Hanford to ensure we elect Randy to Co
 ngress! Please make sure to bring your cell phones\, a tote bag for lit\, 
 walking shoes\, hats\, sunscreen and water. If you have a clipboard\, plea
 se bring it.
LOCATION:Hanford\, CA
URL:https://www.mobilize.us/randyvillegas/event/951269/
X-SOURCE:Indivisible Yolo (Mobilize)
END:VEVENT
